Cloud(EBS) will be used to store volume. We have two types to use this. Static and Dynamic. 

# In static, A cloud admin will allow a storage, of lets say 100GB. from that, K8s admin will allow a storage, of lets say 25GB. from the devs will request for a storage, of say 10GB. This will now be mounted on to the pods. At the end the data is stored in the cloud(EBS). even if the cluster crahses we dont lose the data.

# In Dynamic, the flow is opposite. Dev ---> 10GB ---> PVC ---> PV ---> EBS.

# the advantage in using dyanamic is, we only purchase the amount of storage that we need.

